<section class="auth-shell"><div class="auth-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A place without performance</p><h1>You do not have to arrive polished.</h1><p>Create an account first. The next screen asks only what helps Chiedza adapt safely to you.</p></div><form class="form-card" method="post" action="/register"><h2>Create account</h2><% if (errors?.length) { %><div class="form-errors"><% errors.forEach(e => { %><p><%= e.msg %></p><% }) %></div><% } %><label>Name<input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name"></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></label><label>Password<input type="password" name="password" required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password"></label><button class="button button-block" type="submit">Continue</button><p class="form-foot">Already have a place? <a href="/login">Sign in</a></p></form></section>
